--- /dev/null
+++ b/moldea/runtimes/order-triage-custom.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Order triage custom runtime
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` is asynchronous and requires the caller to supply `loadCanonicalInstruction`. The factory requests `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md` through that loader before returning the agent; a loader rejection prevents creation. The returned object fixes the agent ID to `order-triage`, the action to `classify-for-human-review`, and `canApproveRefunds` to `false`.
+
+This repository does not contain the loader implementation or its runtime registration.
